## Model card

- **Name:** Kimi K2.8 Preview
- **Short description:** Moonshot AI's mid-tier coding/agentic checkpoint (2026-09-11) living behind the `kimi-for-coding` alias inside Kimi Code — positioned between K2.7 Code and flagship K3; 1M context on every membership tier with adjustable thinking (low/high/max).
- **Provider / access:** Kimi Code membership surface only (alias `kimi-for-coding`); **not** on the open platform API model list; **no OpenCode Zen Free ID** (`noFreeId: true`); no per-token public price (membership plan).
- **Release / knowledge:** 2026-09-11 (Kimi Code changelog / LLM Stats); knowledge cutoff not published.
- **IDs:** `moonshot/kimi-k2-8-preview` (logical); runtime model ID remains `kimi-for-coding`.
- **Context window:** 1,048,576 input (all membership tiers); max output not published; visual input images + video (per Intelligent Living comparison table).
- **Modalities:** text/image/video in; text out; thinking effort low/high/max (default max); functions/vision per LLM Stats provider row; tool calls implied by coding-agent product but no public JSON-mode/tool-accuracy bench.
- **Pricing (as of 2026-09-22):** No public per-token rate (Kimi membership / Kimi Code plans only). Secondary indexes show no open-platform price row for K2.8 Preview (llm-stats provider table: "—" pricing).
- **Architecture:** proprietary; no parameter count, architecture write-up, or open weights published. Claims of "2.8T params" are misattributions of K3's figure; K2.7-Code-style 1T/32B-active reuse is speculation only (Intelligent Living).

